ic missing its `-ai-signals.md` file fails the same artifact contract as a main-plan epic.\n399\t\n400\tDocument branches in the decomposition summary. Branch epics are excluded from the main-plan critical path; `epic_count` may count either main-plan epics only or all epics including branches.\n401\t\n402\tDo not return a summary. Your work is complete when the decomposition summary and all epic files exist in `artifacts/epic-tasks/`.\n403\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc41327d4da8db79","agent_id":"a2d82a183a8b02315","session_id":"fe4ca012-5faa-48b1-8411-cb7bf6367dc7","uuid":"781e1118-aae8-4365-a79a-5a6ea3a57317","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:35:24.269Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-935f5ffc09b6b49d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9017"}
