{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-ae42a8c0-e582-4b7d-9395-2aa25093a2dd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e4964056baa08db","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9017-6lz3r77n/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9017-E001.md","content":"# Keyboard accessibility remediation for the four audited core Dashboard flows\n\n## Description\n\nThis epic delivers full keyboard operability and consistent visible focus indicators across the four core Dashboard flows named in the accessibility audit: project creation, workbench spawn, model deployment, and pipeline run submission. It resolves every keyboard-related defect enumerated in the audit report — focus lost in modals, controls unreachable via keyboard, and inconsistent focus indicators — so that each flow can be completed end-to-end with keyboard alone.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Remediate all keyboard-accessibility defects the audit report enumerates for the four audited flows (project creation, workbench spawn, model deployment, pipeline run submission), including:\n  - Modal focus management: focus moves into the modal on open, is trapped within it while open, and returns to the invoking control on close.\n  - Keyboard reachability of every control in the audited flows (no mouse-only interactions).\n- Make visible focus indicators consistent across all interactive controls in the audited flows.\n- Verify each flow with a manual keyboard-only walk-through (Tab / Shift+Tab / Enter / Space / Arrow keys / Escape as applicable) covering the full happy path of the flow.\n- Flows and defects outside the four audited ones, and screen-reader semantics beyond what the keyboard fixes require, are out of scope per the strategy.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Each of the four audited flows (project creation, workbench spawn, model deployment, pipeline run submission) can be completed end-to-end using keyboard alone, verified by a manual keyboard-only walk-through of each flow's happy path.\n- No focus traps exist outside open modals, and no control in the audited flows is unreachable by keyboard.\n- Focus enters each modal on open, remains within it while open, and returns to the invoking control on close, for every modal in the audited flows.\n- Visible focus indicators are present and stylistically consistent on every interactive control in the audited flows.\n- Every defect enumerated in the audit report for these flows is resolved or explicitly dispositioned with rationale.\n- Existing Dashboard automated tests continue to pass with the changes in place.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-1 (P1):** The four audited core flows are fully operable by keyboard, with no focus traps or unreachable controls — this is the core deliverable of this epic.\n- **HLR-2 (P1):** Visible focus indicators are consistent across the audited flows — delivered by the same remediation pass over the same four flows and controls.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":25673,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc41327d4da8db79","agent_id":"a2d82a183a8b02315","session_id":"fe4ca012-5faa-48b1-8411-cb7bf6367dc7","uuid":"2c758d20-307a-48b3-90e1-0676dea9fffb","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:37:21.046Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9017"}
