{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b9d7ee29137c75ed","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9017-E001\n3\ttitle: Keyboard accessibility remediation for the four audited core Dashboard flows\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9017\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 1\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 8\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Keyboard accessibility remediation for the four audited core Dashboard flows\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tThis epic delivers full keyboard operability and consistent visible focus indicators across the four core Dashboard flows named in the accessibility audit: project creation, workbench spawn, model deployment, and pipeline run submission. It resolves every keyboard-related defect enumerated in the audit report — focus lost in modals, controls unreachable via keyboard, and inconsistent focus indicators — so that each flow can be completed end-to-end with keyboard alone.\n34\t\n35\t## Scope\n36\t\n37\t- Remediate all keyboard-accessibility defects the audit report enumerates for the four audited flows (project creation, workbench spawn, model deployment, pipeline run submission), including:\n38\t  - Modal focus management: focus moves into the modal on open, is trapped within it while open, and returns to the invoking control on close.\n39\t  - Keyboard reachability of every control in the audited flows (no mouse-only interactions).\n40\t- Make visible focus indicators consistent across all interactive controls in the audited flows.\n41\t- Verify each flow with a manual keyboard-only walk-through (Tab / Shift+Tab / Enter / Space / Arrow keys / Escape as applicable) covering the full happy path of the flow.\n42\t- Flows and defects outside the four audited ones, and screen-reader semantics beyond what the keyboard fixes require, are out of scope per the strategy.\n43\t\n44\t## Acceptance Criteria\n45\t\n46\t- Each of the four audited flows (project creation, workbench spawn, model deployment, pipeline run submission) can be completed end-to-end using keyboard alone, verified by a manual keyboard-only walk-through of each flow's happy path.\n47\t- No focus traps exist outside open modals, and no control in the audited flows is unreachable by keyboard.\n48\t- Focus enters each modal on open, remains within it while open, and returns to the invoking control on close, for every modal in the audited flows.\n49\t- Visible focus indicators are present and stylistically consistent on every interactive control in the audited flows.\n50\t- Every defect enumerated in the audit report for these flows is resolved or explicitly dispositioned with rationale.\n51\t- Existing Dashboard automated tests continue to pass with the changes in place.\n52\t\n53\t## HLR Traceability\n54\t\n55\t- **HLR-1 (P1):** The four audited core flows are fully operable by keyboard, with no focus traps or unreachable controls — this is the core deliverable of this epic.\n56\t- **HLR-2 (P1):** Visible focus indicators are consistent across the audited flows — delivered by the same remediation pass over the same four flows and controls.\n57\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-814155bc85e696fc","agent_id":"a5e733ed339cd97d5","session_id":"fe4ca012-5faa-48b1-8411-cb7bf6367dc7","uuid":"ba24f3c9-4682-40c9-9052-6e97b59cfd67","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:38:48.232Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b9d7ee29137c75ed","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","sou